{
  "id": "2CH.25",
  "number": "25",
  "bookId": "2CH",
  "reference": "2 Byok 25",
  "verseCount": 28,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "25",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "2CH 25"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "25",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Omukama Amaziya owa Yuda",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 25:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Amaziya kuteera engoma, akaba ahikize emyaka amakumi abiri n'etaano, akalemera emyaka amakumi abiri na mwenda, ali omu rubuga Yerusaalemu. Ibara lya nyina, nuwe Yehoadaani owa Yerusaalemu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.25.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.25.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 25:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Akakora ebirukusemeza MUKAMA, baitu aina omutima ogutabuzirwemu kamogo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.25.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.25.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 25:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Akarumisa kuguma ha ngoma ye, yaita abaheereza be, abakaba baisire omukama ise. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.25.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.25.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 25:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "DEU.24.16"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Bir 24:16",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Baitu abaana baabo atabaite, ekyahandiikirwe omu Biragiro omu kitabu kya Musa nkooku kirukugamba, MUKAMA nambere yaragiriire ati: “Baisebaana bataliitwa habw'emisango ey'abaana baabo, abaana nabo bataliitwa habw'emisango eya baisebo, buli muntu aitirwege omusango ogu ayecweriire wenka.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.25.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.25.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Nihacweka Obulemu Obw'okuseesira Edomu",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 25:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.25.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.25.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 25:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hanyuma, Amaziya yasorooza abantu ba Yuda, yabateekaniza amaju ga baisenkurubo nkooku gali, nibalemwa engabwa ez'abantu enkumi, n'ez'ebikumi, babe ba Yuda yoona na Benyamiini. Akasorooza abo abahikize emyaka amakumi abiri n'okweyongerayo, akaija kurora, bahikire obusiiriira busatu, abasoroirwe omu bandi, abahikire kurwana obulemu, abarukusobora kurwanisa amacumu n'engabu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.25.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.25.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 25:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kandi yapangisa omu Isirairi, abaserikale ab'amaani, emanzi, akasiiriira kamu, yasasura kiloguraamu ez'efeeza enkumi isatu n'ebbina. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.25.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.25.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 25:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Baitu omuntu wa Ruhanga akamuhikaho yamugambira ati, “Mwebingwa otaikiriza kugenda n'ihe erya Isirairi, habwokuba MUKAMA tali hamu na Isirairi, tali hamu n'Ab'Efuraimu abo boona. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.25.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.25.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 25:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Baitu obu oraaba nooteekereza ngu, eki nikyo kiraakufoora w'amaani osingule obulemu, Ruhanga naija kukukenya hansi, omumaiso g'abanyanzigwa; habwokuba Ruhanga, nuwe agaba kusingura, rundi kusingurwa.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.25.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.25.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 25:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Amaziya yakaguza omuntu wa Ruhanga ati, “Oburooro bwa sente ezi mpaire ihe rya Isirairi, ife ki?” Omuntu wa Ruhanga yagarukamu ati, “MUKAMA naasobora kukuha, ezirukukira muno ezi.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.25.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.25.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 25:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Amaziya, nukwo kuraga ihe eryarugire hali Efuraimu, ligaruke litaahe. Baabiihirirwa muno Yuda, baagaruka omuka, ekiniga kiraaliire kubaita. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.25.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.25.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 25:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Baitu Amaziya yaguma, yaramaga hamu n'abantu be, yagenda ha kihanga eky'ekisura, yaita abantu ba Seiri, akakumi kamu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.25.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.25.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 25:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abantu aba Yuda, baahamba kakumi akandi, bali boomeezi, baabatembya ha mwandara eruguru baabasindika hansi; boona baaberenguka. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.25.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.25.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 25:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Baitu ihe liri, Amaziya eri yagarwiire enyuma tiyaliikiriza kuramaga na uwe, lyaseesira embuga za Yuda, okuruga Samaria okugarukira Besi-horoni, lyaita abantu obukumi busatu aba lyasangiremu, lyanyaga omunyago mwingi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.25.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.25.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 25:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.25.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.25.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 25:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Amaziya obu yarugire kwita Ab'Edomu, abantu ba Seiri, akabaihaho baaruhanga baabo, yabeeforra baaruhanga be, yabaramya yabahongera ebihongwa eby'okwokya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.25.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.25.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 25:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "MUKAMA nukwo kumubiihiirirwa yamutumira omurangi, yamukaguza ati, “Kiki ekyakwebingisize baaruhanga ab'abantu abatarasoboire kujuna abantu baabo bonyini, bakabakwihaho?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.25.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.25.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 25:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Obwakaba naakyabaza, Amaziya yamucwamu naagamba ati, “Niwe twakomere obege muhi w'amagezi w'omukama? Culeera! Obu otaaculeere, ninkwita!” Omurangi nukwo kuculeera baitu yagamba ati, “Hati, namanya Ruhanga nkooku amaliriire kukuhwerekereza, nikyo okoliire kinu, kandi wayanga kwikiriza amagezi nkuhaire.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.25.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.25.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 25:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.25.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.25.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 25:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Amaziya omukama wa Yuda, nubwo yayehanwize, yatumaho Yowaasi mutabani wa Yehoyahazi mutabani wa Yehu, omukama wa Isirairi naagamba ati, “Oije, turorangane, amaiso n'amaiso.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.25.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.25.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 25:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yowaasi omukama wa Isirairi, yagarukamu Amaziya omukama wa Yuda, naagamba ati, “Omutojo ogwa Lebbanoni, gukatumaho omukogoto nagwo gwa Lebbanoni, nigugamba guti, ‘Ohe mutabani wange omuhara wawe amuswere’; hakarabaho enyamaiswa ey'omwirungu eya Lebbanoni, yarubaatirra omutojo ogu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.25.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.25.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 25:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Noogamba oti, ‘Orole nkooku ntiire Edomu,’ nooyenyumiza. Baitu hati, oikale omuka. Habwaki nooyeyetera akabi akaraakuhwerekereza, kandi akaraahwerekereza Yuda?”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.25.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.25.19"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 25:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.25.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.25.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 25:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Baitu Amaziya atahurre; habwokuba eki, kikakorwa Ruhanga, akakigenderra kubanagira abanyanzigwa baabo habwokuba bakeebinga baaruhanga ab'Edomu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.25.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.25.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 25:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yowaasi omukama wa Isirairi nukwo kugenda; bakwatangana n'Amaziya omukama wa Yuda, omu rubuga Besi-semesi orwa Yuda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.25.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.25.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 25:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Isirairi yasingura Yuda, buli muntu yairuka naagaruka omuka ye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.25.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.25.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 25:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yowaasi omukama wa Isirairi, yahamba Amaziya omukama wa Yuda, mutabani wa Yowaasi, mwijukuru w'Ahaziya, yamuhambira Besi-semesi, yamutwara Yerusaalemu, yaseesa ekisiika ky'orubuga, okuruga ha irembo ery'Efuraimu okugarukira ha irembo erya ha keekubo, omwanya ogwa mita nk'ebikumi bibiri. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.25.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.25.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 25:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yanyaga ezaabbu n'efeeza yoona, n'ebikwato byona ebyasangirwe omunju ya Ruhanga, yataho n'Obededomu; atamarre aho, yanyaga n'ebintu eby'omu kaaruziika y'omukama, n'abantu abakaba bakwasirwe babe musimbo, yagaruka Samaliya.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.25.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.25.24"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 25:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.25.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.25.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 25:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yowaasi mutabani wa Yehoyahazi omukama wa Isirairi obu yamazire kufa, Amaziya mutabani wa Yowaasi omukama wa Yuda, akoomeera emyaka ikumi n'etaano. ",
          "type": "text",
