              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Okuruga obu yayecwireho MUKAMA, abantu aba Yerusaalemu, baamuliirana, nukwo kwirukira Lakisi. Lakisi baamukurasaayo abantu, nuho baamunagire. ",
          "type": "text",
